  "content": "<p>Возвращает иконки еды/голода в HUD к стандартным, «ванильным», когда они размещаются поверх других ресурс-паков. Полезно для замены текстур при использовании других ресурс-паков, которые могут ухудшить их внешний вид.</p><p>Теперь совместим с <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Appleskin</a> и <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>!</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1423741/description_88918819-52a7-4a15-85e0-901bfaf8cba6.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Я создал это в первую очередь для того, чтобы вернуть эти текстуры еды/голода из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unique Dark</a>:</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1423741/description_fb6367d2-0e1b-43bd-a232-f6df8c8f96fa.png\" width=\"549\" height=\"73\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https:/curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vanilla-hearts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1423741/description_513ca6b2-58fb-4dad-b71b-401359716cea.gif\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><br><span style=\"color:#51ade3\"><a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Нажмите здесь или на изображение выше, чтобы получить версию с показом здоровья/сердец</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Вам также может быть интересно:</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_046f7197-b381-44ca-bc3a-d0da10fd3695.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2c9cb330-cfc0-4c34-9a5c-bf7745f617de.webp\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8d19c886-7699-4f2a-bdf8-eaebcd8d2dbd.webp\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#51ade3\"><a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Старая вода</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Старый Бедрок</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Новый Бедрок</a><br><br></span><br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355031/description_d95d6082-b094-4c9d-82ee-b3bb4ef67702.png\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355031/description_cf1d428e-b393-4de1-80c2-cf3459479226.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354464/description_29b2415a-fdfa-44d9-ab13-1460a2fe0fa3.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354464/description_19500206-d034-4eef-9698-16a7c87cacba.png\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#51ade3\"><a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Глушители поршней</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Более тихие поршни</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Глушители диспенсеров и дропперов</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Более тихие диспенсеры и дропперы</a></span></strong></p>",
